<ul style="
    font-size:12px;
    line-height:1.8;
    color:#475569;
    margin:12px 0 0;
    padding-left:20px;
">
    <li>
        <strong>Annual Goals:</strong>
        Weighted by each DGroup's starting S4E population.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>Overall Completion:</strong>
        Total S4Es removed divided by the starting population.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>Actual Monthly Pace:</strong>
        Average removals across completed calendar months only.
        The current partial month is excluded.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>Needed Monthly Pace:</strong>
        Remaining annual goal divided by remaining calendar
        months, including the current month.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>Annual Goal Attainment:</strong>
        May exceed 100% when removals surpass the assigned
        annual target. Green progress bars indicate the
        annual goal has been met.
    </li>
</ul>
